      "category": "AR AugmentedReality",
      "signature": "GetEstimateSize(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UARTrackedImage*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FVector2D",
      "docs": "Get the estimate size of the detected image, where X is the estimated width, and Y is the estimated height.\nNote that ARCore can return a valid estimate size of the detected image when the tracking state of the UARTrackedImage\nis tracking. The size should reflect the actual size of the image target, which could be different than the input physical\nsize of the candidate image.\nARKit will return the physical size of the ARCandidate image."
    },
