          "type": "Float",
          "default": "10.f"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Try to determine the classification of the object at a world space location\n@InWorldLocation: the world location where the classification is needed\n@OutClassification: the classification result\n@OutClassificationLocation: the world location at where the classification is calculated\n@MaxLocationDiff: the max distance between the specified world location and the classification location\n@return: whether a valid classification result is calculated"
